      ":question/problem": "The area under the curve $y=\\sqrt{4x+8}$ between $x=-2$ and $x=2$ and the $x$-axis is approximated by a right Riemann sum using $8$ subintervals of equal length. What is the expression for the right Riemann sum ${S}_{R}$ in sigma notation?\n\n*Hint: Write down the expression in terms of $i.$*\n\n${S}_{R}=\\frac{1}{2}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{8}$\n{{field-1}}"
