      ":question/problem": "The area under the curve $y=\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(4x-3)$ between $x=1$ and $x=3$ and the $x$-axis is approximated by a right Riemann sum using $n$ subintervals of equal length. What is the expression for the right Riemann sum ${S}_{R}$ in sigma notation?\n\n*Hint: Write down the expression in terms of $j$ and $n.$*\n\n${S}_{R}={\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\frac{2}{n}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061($\n{{field-1}} $)$"
